u're wrong", "vo": "A stop goes where the idea is proved wrong. Then size the position from the stop, not the other way round.", "chart": null}, {"kind": "outro", "text": "Under the level. Always.", "vo": "Put the stop under the level. Follow for more, and practise at memestreet.net.", "chart": null}], "caption": "Don't put your stop a hair under your entry. Put it under the level.\nThe tight stop was hit after one candle, by ordinary noise.\nThe stop just below support wasn't hit.\nA stop goes where the idea is proved wrong. Size the position from the stop.\nFollow for one chart rule a day.\nPractise at memestreet.net\nFictional market. Not investment advice.\n#MemeStreet #StopLoss #SupportAndResistance #RiskManagement", "charts": [{"candles": [[186.88, 187.2, 185.67, 186.33, 13986], [186.31, 186.86, 186.29, 186.86, 5134], [186.88, 187.51, 186.87, 187.44, 2149], [187.44, 187.71, 187.44, 187.56, 4064], [187.56, 187.68, 187.56, 187.65, 1521], [187.65, 187.8, 187.62, 187.79, 1389], [187.35, 187.38, 186.57, 186.76, 6711], [186.77, 187.02, 186.75, 186.93, 3942], [186.91, 186.98, 186.65, 186.95, 3765], [186.95, 187.35, 186.83, 187.35, 2628], [187.35, 187.35, 185.98, 186.01, 1528], [186.07, 186.38, 185.62, 185.62, 2768], [187.2, 190.73, 182.44, 190.24, 47466], [190.25, 191.18, 189.19, 190.75, 9559], [190.7, 190.85, 189.69, 190.74, 7756], [190.77, 191.01, 189.63, 190.74, 12536], [190.73, 190.87, 190.57, 190.85, 2205], [190.86, 190.88, 190.18, 190.21, 2349], [190.41, 192.31, 189.95, 192.16, 12547], [192.06, 193.44, 192.06, 193.1, 6680], [193.2, 193.87, 193.08, 193.28, 5324], [193.28, 193.82, 192.77, 193.65, 6291], [193.65, 194.36, 193.61, 194.12, 1805], [194.1, 194.37, 193.86, 194.01, 2664], [194.04, 197.87, 194.01, 197.63, 9384], [197.72, 198.12, 197.28, 197.42, 3970], [197.4, 197.61, 196.02, 196.97, 6410], [196.82, 198.33, 196.71, 198.05, 10007], [198.07, 198.68, 198.01, 198.48, 2776], [198.48, 198.7, 198.3, 198.47, 1507], [198.15, 198.36, 196.44, 197.89, 5922], [197.86, 